{"w":2400,"lines":[{"w":0.069958845774332645,"c":0.5,"x":0.7716049391467531,"t":"1718867188","h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.046511627815394085},{"h":0.014982482991033219,"w":0.11328221638997397,"y":0.053555270117118692,"x":0.11516959128233063,"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts"},{"x":0.11490773853789121,"c":1,"y":0.097804932563569369,"h":0.012238972038206231,"t":"JACINTA:","w":0.060307979583740234},{"h":0.0091022254440613626,"y":0.22800702679313201,"c":1,"w":0.051567198435465506,"t":"CLIENT:","x":0.11722051590601168},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1,"t":"JACINTA:","y":0.24273255803821592,"x":0.11728395161735961,"w":0.055555553436279298},{"h":0.0087209303892965551,"c":1,"w":0.051440327962239588,"y":0.25726744176392735,"t":"CLIENT:","x":0.1172839511466237},{"x":0.20987654905441672,"c":1,"w":0.57201644897460935,"y":0.097383720823266295,"t":"Of course. So all our cleaners are very carefully selected. When they apply to","h":0.011627907185728703},{"w":0.55967076619466138,"h":0.011778563015312105,"x":0.20781893778827262,"c":1,"y":0.11189634877373622,"t":"us, they have to undergo a security check with the police to make sure they"},{"w":0.59053497314453129,"y":0.12632508820653832,"c":1,"t":"don't have any sort of criminal background, and, of course, they have to provide","x":0.20781893307647559,"h":0.011778563015312105},{"c":1,"t":"references as well. Then if we think they might be suitable for the job, we give","x":0.2078189268022004,"w":0.57613169352213545,"h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.13953488359880262},{"y":0.15547703170867067,"x":0.20781892397325863,"t":"them training for it. That lasts for two weeks so it's very thorough, and at the end","w":0.59465021769205728,"h":0.011778563015312216,"c":1},{"h":0.013081394460653373,"t":"of it, they have a test. If they pass that, we take them on, but we monitor them","y":0.16860465138885938,"w":0.57818929036458333,"x":0.20781893105227633,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.20781895545585627,"w":0.58847732543945308,"y":0.18313953514707593,"t":"very carefully - we ask all our clients to complete a review of their performance","h":0.011627906062437354},{"h":0.011778563015312105,"t":"after every visit and to email it to us. So we can pick up any problems","x":0.20781893613483995,"y":0.19758539485178173,"c":1,"w":0.51440327962239585},{"t":"straightaway and deal with them.","x":0.20769876023007744,"y":0.21199158984660782,"w":0.24717674255371092,"h":0.01335709732469037,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.20987653839709272,"t":"OK, well that all sounds good. And will I always have the same cleaner?","y":0.22673733779432736,"h":0.011778563015312105,"w":0.5308642069498698},{"y":0.2411660777884177,"h":0.011778563015312105,"t":"Yes, we do our best to organise it that way, and we usually manage it.","w":0.51646092732747395,"c":1,"x":0.20781891894901691},{"y":0.2558139533807201,"w":0.40123456319173167,"x":0.20987654545559684,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"t":"Good. That's fine. Right, so I'd like to go ahead and ..."},{"w":0.026748971939086985,"t":"Q8","x":0.83333333286619049,"c":1,"y":0.111918604498221,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"x":0.83333333286790523,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.026748971939086763,"c":1,"y":0.1395348835379695,"t":"Q9"},{"y":0.18313953472528788,"w":0.037037035624186254,"c":1,"x":0.83333333393687814,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q10"},{"t":"PART 2","c":1,"w":0.096830431620279947,"y":0.30066575325048817,"h":0.014947563234291028,"x":0.11722264417148258},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.11728396056048174,"y":0.32703488360063981,"w":0.65637858072916666,"c":1,"t":"As many of you here today have worked in the hotel industry for some time, I'm sure you"},{"t":"have experienced the problem of high staff turnover in your hotels. Every hotel relies on","h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.34156976730718525,"x":0.11522633112151823,"c":1,"w":0.65226338704427078},{"h":0.013250883392226243,"t":"having loyal and experienced members of staff who make sure that everything runs smoothly.","y":0.35600706732715159,"x":0.11728395481220256,"w":0.69341562906901044,"c":1},{"x":0.11522633545515362,"y":0.37063953475073075,"c":1,"h":0.014534883982160629,"w":0.67901234944661459,"t":"If staff are constantly changing, it can make life difficult for everyone. But why do staff leave"},{"t":"frequently in many hotels? Of course, many hotel jobs, such as cleaning, are low-skilled and","h":0.01545891464107596,"y":0.38388685499426134,"c":1,"w":0.68327326456705739,"x":0.11719508735716781},{"t":"are not well-paid. A lot of managers think it's this and the long hours that are the main causes","x":0.11728393857768651,"h":0.011778563015312216,"c":1,"w":0.68930043538411456,"y":0.39958775030511307},{"c":1,"t":"of high staff turnover - but what they don't realise is that it's the lack of training in many hotel","w":0.69135803222656245,"x":0.11522633357448409,"y":0.41424418591358925,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"x":0.11316872672447412,"t":"jobs which is a huge factor.","w":0.20576131184895832,"y":0.42873969378232735,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.45053003555582882,"t":"So, what kind of problems does a high turnover of staff cause? Well, having to recruit new","x":0.11728394234586811,"w":0.66460906982421875,"h":0.011778563015312105},{"w":0.68526107788085944,"t":"staff all the time can be very time-consuming, and managers may have to cover some duties","y":0.46358805863450969,"h":0.013978641361735322,"x":0.11724760603607592,"c":1},{"t":"while waiting for new staff to arrive. This means they don't have time to think about less","h":0.014839707049941531,"x":0.11722912893322729,"c":1,"w":0.6462045288085938,"y":0.47765917328927654},{"x":0.11728394558307466,"c":1,"t":"immediate problems such as how to improve their service. When staff leave, it can also","y":0.49263839811127907,"w":0.64609054565429691,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.11522634363743264,"t":"severely affect the colleagues they leave behind. It has a negative effect on remaining staff,","y":0.50726744172734384,"c":1,"w":0.68106994628906248},{"h":0.01654783997013376,"y":0.52029050823983602,"w":0.50635681152343759,"c":1,"x":0.11514436986913949,"t":"who may start to feel that they too should be thinking about leaving."},{"t":"So, what can be done to change this situation? Firstly, managers should stop making basic","x":0.11728394956752453,"y":0.54358068337659093,"h":0.013250883392226243,"w":0.67283950805664061,"c":1},{"h":0.013250883392226243,"y":0.55800942280905463,"w":0.69341562906901033,"c":1,"x":0.11728395491814231,"t":"errors which leave their staff feeling upset and resentful. When organising shifts, for example,"},{"y":0.5726744184979895,"w":0.63168726603190106,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"make sure you never give certain staff preferential treatment. All staff should be given","x":0.11934155205982791},{"x":0.11728395868692587,"c":1,"h":0.011778563015312105,"t":"some choice about when they work, and everyone should have to work some evening and","y":0.58716136632440719,"w":0.66872426350911462},{"c":1,"t":"weekend shifts. If you treat staff fairly, they'Il be more likely to step in and help when extra","w":0.66255142211914064,"h":0.01309680320910489,"y":0.60174418592677748,"x":0.11728395962287143},{"c":1,"t":"staff are needed.","h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.61482558126387876,"w":0.12962963104248049,"x":0.11728394982548948},{"t":"Keeping staff happy has other tangible benefits for the business. Take the Dunwich Hotel","y":0.63662790685713999,"w":0.65843622843424476,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.1193415564615674},{"t":"as an example. It had been experiencing a problem with staff complaints and in order to","h":0.015304099263796611,"c":1,"w":0.65034866333007812,"y":0.65030792740662668,"x":0.1172146257614862},{"x":0.11728394959430527,"t":"deal with this, invested in staff training and improved staff conditions. Not only did the level","y":0.66569767429671933,"w":0.67283950805664072,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1},{"t":"of complaints fall, but they also noticed a significant increase in the amount each customer","c":1,"w":0.6748971048990885,"x":0.11522634452066749,"y":0.68021201414433685,"h":0.013101939458588618},{"y":0.69464075358449939,"w":0.68312759399414058,"c":1,"t":"spent during their stay. They have now introduced a customer loyalty scheme which is going","x":0.11728393920499323,"h":0.011778563015312216},{"w":0.080345961252848305,"h":0.011973948304588533,"x":0.11723442639644484,"t":"really well.","c":1,"y":0.70912930477046232},{"c":1,"t":"Q11","y":0.41424418588535317,"h":0.013081395583944833,"x":0.83333333351203231,"w":0.032921810150146502},{"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186254,"x":0.83333333401689624,"h":0.013081395583944833,"t":"Q12","y":0.44912790678651593},{"w":0.037037035624186254,"c":1,"x":0.83333333393687814,"t":"Q13","h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.57267441846382172},{"t":"Q14","y":0.68023255798110183,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.83333333393687814},{"y":0.75145348825252689,"t":"Now I'd like to look at some ways you can reduce staff turnover in your hotels, and I'll do this","x":0.11934155269207186,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.68312759399414058},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"y":0.76442873965859559,"x":0.1172839615688496,"w":0.55349792480468751,"t":"by giving some examples of hotels where I've done some training recently."},{"w":0.69135803222656245,"x":0.11728394675138806,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"y":0.78621908106101723,"t":"The Sun Club received feedback which showed that staff thought managers didn't value their"},{"c":1,"x":0.11728395583016001,"y":0.80087209291653594,"h":0.011627907185728703,"w":0.68724278767903646,"t":"opinions. They weren't made to feel they were partners who were contributing to the success"},{"h":0.012917809548170234,"c":1,"x":0.11725297143153597,"t":"of the business as a whole. This situation has changed. Junior staff at all levels are regularly.","y":0.81537068222019515,"w":0.68731226603190099},{"w":0.38904909769694013,"x":0.11721244547828709,"c":1,"t":"invited to meetings where their ideas are welcomed.","y":0.82972664721640665,"h":0.013000484349730446},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"114","y":0.86773255798110183,"c":1,"x":0.11728395099854647,"w":0.03497942288716635},{"t":"Q15","w":0.037037035624186143,"x":0.83333333394292997,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.80087209286722738,"c":1},{"w":0.30619837443033859,"h":0.035152653221247165,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","c":1,"x":0.66984496081179823,"y":0.95314993691982619}],"h":3395}